{"title":"Noragami: Stray God","overview":"Yato is a homeless god. He doesn’t even have a shrine, not to mention worshippers! So to achieve his ambitious goals, he’s set up a service to help those in need (for a small fee), hoping he’ll eventually raise enough money to build himself the lavish temple of his dreams. Of course, he can’t afford to be picky, so Yato accepts all kinds of jobs, from finding lost kittens to helping a student overcome bullies at school. \n\n(Source: Kodansha USA)","year":2010,"status":"ended","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Drama","Fantasy","Romance","Shounen","Supernatural","Tragedy"],"rating":8.3,"seriesType":"manga","metadata":{"images":[{"coverType":"poster","url":"/demo/MediaCover/180a0ac5-a423-8972-93e1-3d1d2f770407/poster-b8636585ed.jpg","remoteUrl":"https://images.mangabaka.dev/5/0/0/d/c/9/4/6/a403/4731/9eca/0a6646a5e865"}],"creators":[{"name":"Adachitoka","roles":["storyAndArt"]}],"externalLinks":[{"name":"MangaBaka","externalId":"2052","url":"https://mangabaka.org/manga/2052/Noragami-Stray-God","relationshipType":1},{"name":"Grand Comics Database","externalId":"104014","url":"https://www.comics.org/series/104014/","relationshipType":1},{"name":"Grand Comics Database","externalId":"136040","url":"https://www.comics.org/series/136040/","relationshipType":1},{"name":"Grand Comics Database","externalId":"190677","url":"https://www.comics.org/series/190677/","relationshipType":1},{"name":"Media Arts Database","externalId":"C91402","url":"https://mediaarts-db.artmuseums.go.jp/id/C91402","relationshipType":1},{"name":"AniList","externalId":"54692","url":"https://anilist.co/manga/54692","relationshipType":1},{"name":"Wikipedia EN","externalId":"Noragami","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Noragami","relationshipType":0},{"name":"Gekkan Shounen Magazine","externalId":"noragami","url":"https://gmaga.co/c/noragami","relationshipType":0},{"name":"Wikipedia","externalId":"ノラガミ","url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%83%8E%E3%83%A9